    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alix</strong> is a 2D adventure game inspired by classic <strong>Zelda-like</strong> titles, with a charming retro pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Romain</strong>, a teenager who wakes from a strange nightmare to find his little sister, <strong>Alix</strong>, has mysteriously vanished, as did the animals. His journey leads him across the forgotten islands of the <strong>Auralia archipelago</strong>\u2014a world full of secrets, ancient legends, and mysterious creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of <strong>hand-crafted islands</strong>, each with unique environments, secrets, and hidden areas;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> and activate ancient mechanisms to progress;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the <strong>forces of evil</strong> in real-time combat;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and <strong>take control of guardian animals</strong>, each with special powers (jumping, fire, traversing forbidden areas...);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the <strong>Guardian Diamonds</strong>, ancient relics of power needed to save the archipelago;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable characters and uncover the truth about the <strong>Guardians\u2019 past</strong>... and your own family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible and evolving gameplay that blends action, exploration, and puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming <strong>16x16 pixel art</strong> visuals inspired by 90s classics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt story full of mystery, magic, and adventure;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and emotional original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alix</strong> is a tribute to the golden age of adventure games, infused with <strong>unique mechanics</strong> centered around the bond with guardian animal spirits.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alix</strong> is a 2D adventure game inspired by classic <strong>Zelda-like</strong> titles, with a charming retro pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Romain</strong>, a teenager who wakes from a strange nightmare to find his little sister, <strong>Alix</strong>, has mysteriously vanished, as did the animals. His journey leads him across the forgotten islands of the <strong>Auralia archipelago</strong>\u2014a world full of secrets, ancient legends, and mysterious creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of <strong>hand-crafted islands</strong>, each with unique environments, secrets, and hidden areas;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> and activate ancient mechanisms to progress;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the <strong>forces of evil</strong> in real-time combat;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and <strong>take control of guardian animals</strong>, each with special powers (jumping, fire, traversing forbidden areas...);</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the <strong>Guardian Diamonds</strong>, ancient relics of power needed to save the archipelago;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet memorable characters and uncover the truth about the <strong>Guardians\u2019 past</strong>... and your own family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible and evolving gameplay that blends action, exploration, and puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming <strong>16x16 pixel art</strong> visuals inspired by 90s classics;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt story full of mystery, magic, and adventure;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive and emotional original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alix</strong> is a tribute to the golden age of adventure games, infused with <strong>unique mechanics</strong> centered around the bond with guardian animal spirits.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this retro pixel-art Zelda-like, set off to find your missing sister and animals on the island of Auralia. Explore the archipelago, solve puzzles, fight evil forces, and harness the powers of guardian animals \u2014 creatures you will embody to overcome obstacles on your journey.",
